https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2","homepage":"http://www.yiiframework.com","size":87780,"stargazers_count":14308,"watchers_count":14308,"language":"PHP","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":6857,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":521,"license":{"key":"bsd-3-clause","name":"BSD 3-Clause \"New\" or \"Revised\" License","spdx_id":"BSD-3-Clause","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/bsd-3-clause","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTU="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["framework","hacktoberfest","php","php-framework","yii","yii2"],"visibility":"public","forks":6857,"open_issues":521,"watchers":14308,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"According to the documentation: \"During the bootstrapping process, each component will be instantiated. If the component class implements yii\\base\\BootstrapInterface\". But that is not entirely true. I have a \"user\" component and a \"user\" module - with the same name and added to the bootstrap section of my config [\"user\"]. The problem is that the current implementation checks that the user component doesn't implement the BootstrapInterface and skips it, but never checks the module with the same name. I think this is inconsistent behavior - what do you guys think ? The problem comes from this code in yii\\base\\Application(line:298)\n\n``` php\n        foreach ($this->bootstrap as $class) {\n            $component = null;\n            if (is_string($class)) {\n                if ($this->has($class)) {\n                    $component = $this->get($class);\n                } elseif ($this->hasModule($class)) {\n                    $component = $this->getModule($class);\n```\n\nHow can I \"bootstrap\" a module with the same id as a component ?\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/10233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/10233/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]